        "text": "Literally have no idea how incredible Grok Bot really is\n\nBasically any task you can think of that you want to do on a laptop it does it... I didn't see it do anything wrong tbh, such as with the tasks that required payment and with things like buying stuff online and booking flights booking hotels\n\nIt absolutely does it better... I was kind of shocked and impressed with all the things it does, and I'm still exploring how many things I can do with Grok Bot... and I just keep adding things",
